    <unit id="b42ee083-9098-4dc0-8927-b48f16cf4b48">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 10</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Custom Labels is an NVDA add-on that allows you to add custom labels for unlabelled controls and edit existing ones. This is particularly useful for applications with buttons or controls that don't have labels or NVDA cannot properly identify.</source>
        <target>自定义标签是一个 NVDA 插件，允许你为未加标签的控件添加自定义标签，并编辑现有的标签。这对于那些按钮或控件没有标签、或 NVDA 无法正确识别的应用程序尤其有用。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
